             "type": "String",
             "textContent": "This site uses CookieConsent, an open-source consent banner, to manage consent. What the site stores falls into the four categories below. Google Analytics only runs after you say yes."
            }
           ]
          },
          {
           "id": {
            "component": "6a89d2fde90b577397cb4611",
