              "element": "8b31a0ec-caf6-2af2-f885-28aaf88958e5"
             },
             "type": "String",
             "textContent": " Keep the site working: your login session (Memberstack), your consent choice itself (CookieConsent, stored on your device). These cannot be switched off."
